----- stdout -----
invisible-unicode (error)

No invisible characters (zero-width, bidi controls, tags) in tool text.

Reviewers cannot see them but models read them, so they can smuggle instructions (webmcp#360, Trojan Source). `--fix` deletes the ones written literally in the source.

https://github.com/webmcpx/webmcpx/blob/main/crates/webmcpx-lint/src/rules/invisible_unicode.rs

